# OPTIM SVNREV df8da599267534fbe43a250e578f7396a7946311, svn.tar.bz2 sha256 738fafe3df5ad73100b7e7d7bbbc407ee8cd5d969c2c0a58f2c109167f463d31. Unmodified gfortran build. Native morse_bulk, A=1 and R0=1. Coordinates, the box, and rcut 9.5 are divided by r0 2.897.
